{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>The face of YHWH</b> — anger, for by the face it is known, as in \"and her face was no longer the same\" (1 Samuel 1:18)."], :book :lamentations, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {0 "The Hebrew citation reads ש\"א א י\"ח; the verse about Hannah's face is 1 Samuel 1:18, so א likely abbreviates the chapter number rather than a second book reference."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Lamentations -- Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%9E%D7%92%D7%99%D7%9C%D7%AA_%D7%90%D7%99%D7%9B%D7%94"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:08:05.954108645Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}